    {
      "id": "vut_lifecycle",
      "rule": "vut.h / vut.c: VUT_Arg, VUT_Setup, VUT_Main, VUT_Signaled and VUT_Fini CHECK_OBJ_NOTNULL(vut, VUT_MAGIC) a VUT from VUT_Init; VUT_Fini (TAKE_OBJ_NOTNULL) frees it. VUT_Setup does AZ(vut->vsm), AZ(vut->vslq) (once per VUT) and VUT_Main AN(vut->vslq) (after VUT_Setup); VUT_Setup consumes the -n/-r/-q/-t options VUT_Arg stores (and VUT_Main does AZ(vut->r_arg) for VSM input, vut.c:469), so options come before VUT_Setup.",
      "formula": "(!x_use W x_new) & G(x_end -> X(!x_use W x_new)) & (!u_main W u_setup) & G(x_new -> X(!u_main W u_setup)) & G(u_setup -> X(!(u_setup | u_arg) W x_new))",
